{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to LexiRogue\u2014 more than just a typing game, it's a learning adventure that blends strategy, science, and personalization. Dive into a roguelite-style journey with buff combinations for thrilling challenges, or follow the scientifically-backed 21-day memory method for steady improvement.  With multi-tier leaderboards and a rich achievement system, your progress and triumphs will be celebrated every step of the way. Join now and make mastering vocabulary an exciting and rewarding journey!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First, download the word library</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853330/extras/49a61c60b5fc57e61aa139b9e7ee5cfb.poster.avif?t=1763429815\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853330/extras/49a61c60b5fc57e61aa139b9e7ee5cfb.webm?t=1763429815\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853330/extras/49a61c60b5fc57e61aa139b9e7ee5cfb.mp4?t=1763429815\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select the downloaded word library to start playing</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853330/extras/02ad6aaa65dfd6aeb966732d8f2d36fc.poster.avif?t=1763429815\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853330/extras/02ad6aaa65dfd6aeb966732d8f2d36fc.webm?t=1763429815\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853330/extras/02ad6aaa65dfd6aeb966732d8f2d36fc.mp4?t=1763429815\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is also a study mode, which can be used to learn words before playing the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853330/extras/a7dc6aa20f7a41d74b88df9bc108212a.poster.avif?t=1763429815\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853330/extras/a7dc6aa20f7a41d74b88df9bc108212a.webm?t=1763429815\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853330/extras/a7dc6aa20f7a41d74b88df9bc108212a.mp4?t=1763429815\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additionally, based on the 21-day memory model, the system will prompt you to review the words for the day. Once completed, the number of words indicated by the arrow will advance sequentially until the entire word bank is finished. The basic review includes &quot;dictation,&quot; where you write out the words based on prompts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853330/extras/643d813f58b7647a8285f3b2f41c2e0f.avif?t=1763429815\" width=1152 height=648 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853330/extras/55bb91ebec7c366fb6bf34f1f883dea7.avif?t=1763429815\" width=1152 height=648 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If answered correctly, the user proceeds to the next review stage. If incorrect, the word is marked as unlearned and the review restarts from the beginning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853330/extras/55bb91ebec7c366fb6bf34f1f883dea7.avif?t=1763429815\" width=1152 height=648 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After completing the review, you can see the specific progress changes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853330/extras/123ed223b3f229bc170f701f44d58115.avif?t=1763429815\" width=1154 height=646 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Currently, it only supports learning English for Chinese speakers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200b</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"\u8d8a\u632b\u8d8a\u52c7","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3853330/f2f564203336c7ccbc25b21d7e5b837cafe1988a.jpg"},{"name":"\u5df2\u7136\u4e0a\u624b","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3853330/51b8cbf67d2fb307fdd121d43e83db34a1dbb759.jpg"},{"name":"I'm Rich","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3853330/b37085b5fa393f0d3c1be20759d573c893b4efdd.jpg"},{"name":"\u5386\u7ecf\u98ce\u971c","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3853330/cfcbe7f3639cfc9a2ed717e5845e46b48762cbca.jpg"},{"name":"\u53e0Buff\u72c2\u9b54","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3853330/4cad94d556b95b6c1af2da4eeb44dcd582411122.jpg"},{"name":"\u521d\u6218\u544a\u6377","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3853330/ffaf8dffbbf9eb7285f2b2745e87621722dff512.jpg"},{"name":"\u767e\u8bcd\u65a9","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3853330/68ee836e1fdfbe23e77b5c05dd7b5010e727fec9.jpg"},{"name":"\u5b66\u6709\u5c0f\u6210","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3853330/0d1716e6282568e3b860bdfcc824fb6f5f5b5c8c.jpg"},{"name":"\u5b66\u9738","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/a